  rewrite (iotaS 0 3) 1:// (iotaS 1 2) 1:// (iotaS 2 1) 1:// (iotaS 3 0) 1:// iota0 1:// /=.
  by rewrite ?h8 ?h16 ?h24 ?IntID.expr0 /=.
